Package: zucsvlink
Title: Static-Archive Consumer Fixture for zucsv
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zucsv as zugodb will, through
    LinkingTo alone: zucsv.h and zucsv-r.h come off the LinkingTo include
    path, and ./configure links the installed libzucsv.a and then
    libzuarrow.a statically, so there is no Imports entry and no run-time
    dependency on either package. It probes the double converter at load
    and reads CSV files through zucsv_open_stream() on a thread that is
    not R's.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: 
    zucsv,
    zuarrow
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    zucsv
Config/testthat/edition: 3
